[{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其五","author":"杨宾","text":"化城开石壁，镫火出林微。\n不见乘杯渡，还看卓锡归。\n閒云埋土室，古佛钓渔矶。\n怪底经行处，天花片片飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16506,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其六","author":"杨宾","text":"城郭沙阑口，荒荒草木秋。\n地连三万卫，名是五云楼。\n眢井填银瓮，春耕响玉钩。\n千年馀王气，今日未全收。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16507,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其七","author":"杨宾","text":"山川盘地轴，草木亦多宜。\n旧塞黄榆树，官山紫桦皮。\n桃花水似锦，香蓼菜如丝。\n谁道穷边外，年年春到迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16508,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其八","author":"杨宾","text":"土产参为最，今时贡帝京。\n营州非旧种，上党亦空名。\n碧叶翻风动，红根照眼明。\n人形品绝贵，闻说可长生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16509,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其九","author":"杨宾","text":"更有诸珍异，宁随草木枯。\n浅沙埋赤玉，老蚌出东珠。\n稗子贫家少，山儿到处无。\n怪来水土变，今日此陪都。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16510,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十","author":"杨宾","text":"八月松花冻，家家打角鹰。\n山边张密网，树底系长绳。\n拦虎金眸疾，屠龙玉爪能。\n海青如便得，万里会骞腾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16511,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十一","author":"杨宾","text":"笑语乡音杂，衣冠上下同。\n十年乘堡障，一半是王公。\n辛苦头多白，沙尘眼易红。\n莫因迁闾左，错比五陵东。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16512,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十二","author":"杨宾","text":"三十年前事，儿童见者稀。\n天寒曳护腊，地冻著麻衣。\n雪积扒犁出，灯残猎马归。\n只今风俗变，一一比皇畿。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16513,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十三","author":"杨宾","text":"迟日争游宴，豪家直一金。\n不嫌几席少，偏爱酒杯深。\n风俗誇卢橘，人情厌海参。\n浑忘绝塞苦，醉里即狂吟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16514,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十四","author":"杨宾","text":"年少新丰客，翩翩亦自豪。\n围棋群赌墅，叶子日分曹。\n果下高丽马，腰间大食刀。\n可怜编卒伍，万里驾风涛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16515,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十五","author":"杨宾","text":"都护屯兵处，传闻驿几重。\n沙边锄白草，雪里试青龙。\n鱼海何时到，狼居自古封。\n谁云枯万骨，王祭肯全供。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16516,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十六","author":"杨宾","text":"俗亦厌贫贱，不复重冠裳。\n贩鬻皆程郑，生涯半彦方。\n参貂口外得，牛马谷中量。\n翻怪中原弱，穷愁遍八荒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16517,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十七","author":"杨宾","text":"闻说羁縻国，西来绝可怜。\n冰天鱼作服，陆地狗行船。\n披发环穿鼻，文身耳压肩。\n由来桑梓地，不是信张骞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16518,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十八","author":"杨宾","text":"少主和亲惯，乘舆出塞门。\n如何经故土，亦是嫁乌孙。\n雕屋三春雪，糠灯万里魂。\n琵琶弹绝调，夜夜泣黄昏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16519,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"宁古塔杂诗 其十九","author":"杨宾","text":"称藩虽渐广，文字尚无凭。\n近塞能书木，临江但结绳。\n冠裳今亦改，风俗旧相仍。\n岁岁愁衣食，春来早凿冰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16520,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元曲 其一","author":"杨宾","text":"谁道今宵是上元，城头画角不闻喧。\n相看独有天边月，万里迢迢照塞门。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16521,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元曲 其二","author":"杨宾","text":"皂帽蒙头犯朔风，醉中踏月过城东。\n无端猎火原头烧，错认龙镫挂碧空。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16522,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元曲 其三","author":"杨宾","text":"夜半村姑著绮罗，嘈嘈社鼓唱秧歌。\n汉家装束边关少，几队□儿簇拥过。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16523,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元曲 其四","author":"杨宾","text":"剪纸为镫号牡丹，西关爆竹似长安。\n谁家年少黄金勒，醉里垂鞭处处看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16524,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"上元曲 其五","author":"杨宾","text":"销金罗帕粉花香，蟒幅齐肩锦绣装。\n百病年年行走惯，阿谁打滚到沙场。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16525,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"庚辰仲冬访牧翁于半野堂奉赠长句","author":"柳是","text":"声名真似汉扶风，妙理玄规更不同。\n一室茶香开澹黯，千行墨妙破冥濛。\n竺西瓶拂因缘在，江左风流物论雄。\n今日沾沾诚御李，东山葱岭莫辞从。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16526,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧翁迎春日偕河东君泛舟东郊作韵","author":"柳是","text":"珠帘从此不须开，又是兰闺梦景来。\n画舫欲移先傍柳，游衫才拂已惊梅。\n东郊金弹行相逐，南陌琼辀度几回。\n最是新诗如玉琯，春风舞袖一时催。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16527,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧翁新正二日偕河东君过拂水山庄梅花半开春条乍放喜而有作韵","author":"柳是","text":"山庄水色变轻苔，并骑亲看万树回。\n容鬓差池梅欲笑，韶光约略柳先催。\n丝长偏待春风惜，香暗真疑夜月来。\n又是度江花寂寂，酒旗歌板首频回。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16528,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵永兴看梅见怀之作","author":"柳是","text":"乡愁春思两欹斜，那得看梅不忆家。\n折赠可怜疏影好，低回应惜薄寒赊。\n穿帘小朵亭亭雪，瀁月流光细细沙。\n欲向此中为阁道，与君坐卧领芳华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16529,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"半野堂燕集次牧翁韵奉赠我闻居士","author":"徐锡胤","text":"舞燕惊鸿见欲愁，书签笔格晚妆楼。\n开颜四座回银烛，咳吐千钟倒玉舟。\n七字诗成才举手，一声曲误又回头。\n佳人那得兼才子，艺苑蓬山第一流。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16530,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辛巳元夕牧翁偕我闻居士载酒携灯过我荒斋牧翁席上诗成依韵奉和","author":"沈璜","text":"乍停歌舞息喧阗，移泊桥西蓬户前。\n弱柳弄风残雪地，老梅破萼早春天。\n酒边花倚灯争艳，帘外云开月正圆。\n夜半诗成多藻思，幽庭芳草倍鲜妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16531,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"辛巳元夕牧翁偕我闻居士载酒携灯过我荒斋牧翁席上诗成依韵奉和","author":"苏先","text":"春城箫鼓竞阗阗，别样风光短烛前。\n残雪楼台行乐地，薄寒衣袂放灯天。\n银花火树如人艳，璧月珠星此夜圆。\n一曲霓裳君莫羡，新诗谁并玉台妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16532,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次韵牧翁《二月十二春分日横山晚归作》","author":"柳是","text":"年光诗思竞鲜新，忽漫韶华逗晚春。\n止为花开停十日，已怜腰缓足三旬。\n枝枝媚柳含香粉，面面夭桃拂软尘。\n回首东皇飞辔促，安歌吾欲撰良辰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16533,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"奉和牧翁陌上花三首 其一","author":"柳是","text":"陌上花开照板扉，鸳湖水涨绿波肥。\n班骓雪后迟迟上，油壁风前缓缓归。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16534,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"依韵奉和牧翁人日示内二首 其一","author":"柳是","text":"春风习习转江城，人日于人倍有情。\n帖胜似能欺舞燕，妆花真欲坐流莺。\n银幡囡戴忻多福，金剪侬收喜罢兵。\n新月半轮灯乍穗，为君酹酒祝长庚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16535,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"依韵奉和牧翁人日示内二首 其二","author":"柳是","text":"佛日初辉人日沉，彩幡清晓供珠林。\n地于劫外风光近，人在花前笑语深。\n洗罢新松看沁雪，行残旧药写《来禽》。\n香灯绣阁存常好，不唱卿家《缓缓吟》。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16536,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其一","author":"柳是","text":"兴来泼墨满吟笺，半是张颠半米颠。\n俗眼迷离浑不辨，嗤它持作画图看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16537,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其二","author":"柳是","text":"暂向幽芳一写真，笔花飞落墨痕新。\n总然冷淡难随俗，岩谷而今有几人？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16538,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其三","author":"柳是","text":"读罢《离骚》酒一壶，残灯照影夜犹孤。\n看来如梦复如幻，未审此身得似无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16539,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其四","author":"柳是","text":"眼界空华假复真，花花叶叶净无尘。\n千秋《琴操》犹馀调，半是骚人现化身。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16540,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其五","author":"柳是","text":"翻风解作《前溪》舞，泣露犹闻《子夜歌》。\n一片幽怀谁领略，托根无地奈渠何。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16541,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其六","author":"柳是","text":"不共青芝石上栽，旨容荆棘与莓苔。\n根苗净洗无尘土，好待东风送雨来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16542,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其七","author":"柳是","text":"泣露啼烟三两枝，写来真作断肠辞。\n怀香老去凭谁惜，独抱奇姿只自知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16543,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其八","author":"柳是","text":"闲评争说所南翁，向后人文半已空。\n莫讶豪偷花叶减，怕它笔墨恼春风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16544,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其九","author":"柳是","text":"晚窗梦醒系相思，静对潇湘九畹姿。\n世眼大都看色相，枝头何不点燕支？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16545,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题顾横波夫人墨兰图册 其十","author":"柳是","text":"懒踏长安九陌尘，独怜空谷十分春。\n豪端画破虚空界，想见临池妙入神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16546,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"横山杂作","author":"柳是","text":"美人遥夜伫何方，应是当年蹭蹬乡。\n自爱文园能犊鼻，那愁世路有羊肠。\n徐看雀坠枝先坠，谁借桃僵李亦僵。\n只此时名皆足废，宁须万事折腰忙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16547,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画竹","author":"柳是","text":"不肯开花不趁妍，萧萧影落砚池边。\n一枝片叶休轻看，曾住名山傲七贤。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16548,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题画梅","author":"柳是","text":"色也凄凉影也孤，墨痕浅晕一枝枯。\n千秋知己何人在，还赚师雄入梦无。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16549,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其一","author":"柳是","text":"为得风骚趣，柴门迥不开。\n人从尘外见，诗向静中来。\n消息须微悟，推敲别有才。\n吟成谁解爱，幽径长莓苔。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16550,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其二","author":"柳是","text":"攓云一径澹风漪，翠筱萧萧冷砚池。\n便仿宋书佥片瓦，官私不许怒蛙知。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16551,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其三","author":"柳是","text":"爱掬溪泉浣砚尘，溪花俱晕墨痕春。\n可知真砚何曾损，七客于中认主宾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16552,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其四","author":"柳是","text":"扁舟载得秋多少，荡过闲云又荡风。\n曾记荻花枫叶外，斜阳输我醉颜红。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16553,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其五","author":"柳是","text":"雨过空亭听乱流，无人渔钓鉴湖秋。\n晚风夕照闲如洗，明月依稀上白头。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16554,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其六","author":"柳是","text":"凉散碧梧影，横琴每夕昏。\n静涵千涧水，坐送隔溪云。\n仙乐钧天梦，秋声落雁群。\n绮寮风细细，香沁藕丝裙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16555,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其七","author":"柳是","text":"枣花帘额暝烟低，清绝疏寮见旧题。\n满径苔□人迹少，仙禽□过竹枝西。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16556,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其八","author":"柳是","text":"叶叶浓愁寸寸阴，碧云天末澹疏吟。\n年时忆听同峰雨，人与芭蕉一样心。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16557,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题山水人物图册 其九","author":"柳是","text":"一重空翠一重烟，楼阁三层小洞天。\n才子最宜花眷属，仙人兮结月婵娟。\n那无俊语酬春色，如此闻根亦破禅。\n谱要替修香要□，东风还要出大千。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16558,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"垂杨碧","author":"柳是","text":"空回首，筠管榴笺依旧。\n裂却紫箫愁最陡，颠倒鸾钗久。\n羡杀枝头豆蔻，闷杀风前杨柳。\n一夜金沟催叶走，细腰空自守。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16559,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋范司马嘉莲作","author":"柳是","text":"风流不坠莫愁城，司马池台胜已并。\n只觉花蓬连理好，尽缘人重合欢名。\n双凌芍药阶前艳，并照荚蓉幕里清。\n从此三生怀渌水，年年开发倍含情。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16560,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"金明池 寒柳","author":"柳是","text":"有恨寒潮，无情残照，正是萧萧南浦。\n更吹起、霜条孤影，还记得、旧时飞絮。\n况晚来、烟浪迷离，见行客、特地瘦腰如舞。\n总一种凄凉，十分憔悴，尚有燕台佳句。\n春日酿成秋日雨。\n念畴昔风流，暗伤如许。\n纵饶有、绕堤画舸，冷落尽、水云犹故。\n念从前、一点春风，几隔着重帘，眉儿愁苦。\n待约个梅魂，黄昏月淡，与伊深怜低语。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16561,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜起","author":"柳是","text":"初月不明庭户暗，流云重叠吐残星。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16562,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"寿陈徵君","author":"柳是","text":"李卫学书称弟子，东方大隐号先生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16563,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题望海楼","author":"柳是","text":"日毂行天沦左界，地机激水卷东溟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16564,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"七言联句","author":"柳是","text":"浅深流水琴中听，远近青山画里看。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16565,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其一","author":"徐波","text":"欲剪吴凇江水悠，早梅时节酿酸愁。\n分开画烛交红泪，锁向雕笼到白头。\n预借仙期偷驾鹊，探偿愿海许沈牛。\n花源一自渔郎问，柳浪春来许系舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16566,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其二","author":"徐波","text":"双栖休比画鸳鸯，真有随身藻荇香。\n移植柔条承宴寝，捧持飞絮入宫墙。\n抱衾无复轮当夕，舞袖虚教列满堂。\n从此凡间归路杳，行云不再到金昌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16567,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其三","author":"徐波","text":"旋周滴限返仙家，一笑相迎路不赊。\n怀梦自珍方朔草，急行须借阿香车。\n长悬素影凭脩月，久驻红颜赖饮霞。\n坐拥群真尝说法，杨枝在手代拈花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16568,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其一","author":"朱隗","text":"凉波三泖路悠悠，望断云軿目眇愁。\n渐觉雨风香渡口，惊闻箫管下峰头。\n卷帷态自迷阳蔡，赠石身看上斗牛。\n借问蓝桥今共室，何如鄂渚昔同舟？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16569,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其二","author":"朱隗","text":"成行罗列尽鸳鸯，面药还存旧赐香。\n已幸根株移北里，不须声影傍东墙。\n山川谢傅携长袖，丝竹张公满后堂。\n千骑上头何足羡，亲曾曳履入文昌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16570,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其三","author":"朱隗","text":"绮窗朱户莫愁家，桃涧藤溪路未赊。\n此夕同心吟月扇，当年倾耳听雷车。\n上眉鸾镜颦成谱，五晕罗裙步起霞。\n一道吴歌采莲伴，争看越女胜如花。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16571,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其四","author":"朱隗","text":"吴江不识几何深，画舫螭头泊柳阴。\n杂佩互投珠是意，名香对爇字为心。\n师经素女盈奇态，仙号青琴足赏音。\n方信蓬壶人世有，何烦餐玉饵黄金。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16572,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其一","author":"林云凤","text":"天上秋期尚缪悠，先从九夏慰离愁。\n垂来柳眼窥帘额，绣出花心粲枕头。\n翠管双吹谐唳鹤，雕阑并倚笑牵牛。\n准知宿世蓝桥侣，即在今宵谷水舟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16573,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"次牧《翁六月七日迎河东君于云间喜而有述》诗 其二","author":"林云凤","text":"鸳鸯湖上学鸳鸯，竟体犹沾杜若香。\n此夜依然来北里，伊人元不隔东墙。\n桃花旖旎如前度，丝竹骈罗即后堂。\n一曲将雏应有待，和鸣早已听归昌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_2.csv","pointer":16574,"sha256":"a1fbd8db5f1605565e4bb98e0e76a1c272c3eb132126b08b18d8cae883b36fd4","dynasty":"清"}}]